travel-ops includes ideas and code adapted from these MIT-licensed projects:

- fare-scraper — https://github.com/Suzzzzik/fare-scraper — Booking.com session recipe, Airbnb page state parsing
- pyairbnb — https://github.com/johnbalvin/pyairbnb — Airbnb field reference
- travel-hacking-toolkit — https://github.com/borski/travel-hacking-toolkit — packaging, browser-source fallbacks
- fli — https://github.com/punitarani/fli — Google Flights search page: the `tfs` query, the `ds:1` result rows, the price token

Each adapted file names its origin in a header comment.
Currency rates by https://www.exchangerate-api.com (open access endpoint).

